- Replayed the exact gate procedure over every file: **68/68 exit 0, 0 failures** (`logs/gate_recheck.json`, `GATE_RECHECK_OK`).
- Re-ran the 4 D10 modules in exact gate style from the worktree root: all exit 0; the 40-query `#print axioms` output is byte-identical to the original and shows only `[propext, Classical.choice, Quot.sound]` — no `sorryAx`/`native_decide`.
- Forbidden-token scan of the authored files: 0 hits; D10 sha256 values unchanged; 58 accepted-D5 provenance hashes re-verified with 0 mismatches.
